---
// Shared by the 404 page and /[site] for paths that aren't hostnames.
---

<div class="wrap page">
  <p class="code"><span aria-hidden="true">&gt;</span> 404: nothing to scoop here</p>
  <h1>This page doesn't exist.</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Looking for a site's scoop? Library pages live at <code>scoop.md/&lt;hostname&gt;</code>, like{' '}
    <a href="/docs.stripe.com">scoop.md/docs.stripe.com</a>.
  </p>
  <p><a href="/">Home</a> · <a href="/library">Library</a></p>
</div>

<style>
  .page {
    padding-top: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem);
  }

  .code {
    font: 500 0.9rem/1.4 var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 1.5rem + 4vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .lede {
    max-width: 52ch;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
</style>
